{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12381","headline":"和韦侍御寓直对雨 · 钱起","name":"和韦侍御寓直对雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名贯四科首，班宜二妙齐。\n如何厌白简，未得步金闺。\n寓直晦秋雨，吟余闻远鸡。\n漏声过旦冷，云色向窗低。\n谁谓霄汉近，翻嗟心事暌。\n兰滋人未握，霜晓鹗还栖。\n伫见田郎字，亲劳御笔题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}